      "content": "thanks, that's a good start. it's much better than the original mess.\n\nbut i just checked the dashboard and this one is sitting way down at the bottom of the pile because the granularity score is too low. for some of these more complex bugs, the leads actually prefer a very deep dive.\n\ncan you try to expand this one out more? i don't want you to just add fluff or nonsense, but try to break down the steps, the environment details, and the observed behaviors into much more granular detail. if you can get the bullet point count up significantly while still being technically accurate, it'll help it move up the queue way faster. thanks!",
